# Vendored LSD reference — OpenCV `lsd.cpp`

This directory vendors the **read-only reference source** that the Rust port
in `dewarp-rs/src/lsd.rs` is written against. Nothing here is compiled; it exists
so the port is auditable against the exact bytes it was derived from.

