reproduce — and two of them (`GaussianBlur`'s 8U fixed-point path and
`INTER_LINEAR_EXACT`) are the highest parity-risk code in the whole port. Recording them by sha alone would have
violated this NOTICE's "auditable against the exact bytes" standard for
precisely that code, so they are vendored verbatim under `aux/`. All are from
